- `deno test` — 3 passed, 0 failed
- `normalizeUrl("https://example.com/?utm_source=dlvr&fbclid=abc123")` → `https://example.com` (both stripped)
- 4 tracking params + a non-tracking `ref` → all four stripped, `ref=keepme` preserved
- URLs without tracking params unchanged (non-regression)

